{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object, approach, grab, check it, or move to next location. Repeat until object found.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = FindPickAndCheckObject    />",
